{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And he said to him who was over his house.</b> He did not wish to speak to his brothers until all who stood attending him had departed, so that he might speak at length with them." "<b>Bring the men into the house.</b> Into the dwelling house, for he was then at the king's gate or in the place where he judged." "<b>For they shall dine with me.</b> To observe their disposition toward Benjamin and to test whether they would be jealous of him when Benjamin's portion was made greater than all their portions."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:24.318800301Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}